# Input
```astro
<!-- should generate diagnostics -->

<div>{(
    <div
        set:html={html}
        set:text={text}
    ></div>
)}</div>

<div>{(
    <Component
        set:html={html}
        set:text={text}
    />
)}</div>

<div>{(
    <div
        set:html={html}
    >child content</div>
)}</div>

<div>{(
    <div
        set:text={text}
    ><span>child content</span></div>
)}</div>

<div>{(
    <div set:html={html} set:text={text}></div>
)}</div>

<div>{(
    <Component set:html={html} set:text={text} />
)}</div>

<div>{(
    <div set:html={html}>child content</div>
)}</div>

<div>{(
    <div set:text={text}><span>child content</span></div>
)}</div>

```

# Diagnostics
