invalid_multiline.astro:5:9 lint/nursery/noAstroConflictingSetDirectives ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

  × The set:html directive conflicts with another content source.
  
    3 │ <div>{(
    4 │     <div
  > 5 │         set:html={html}
      │         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
    6 │         set:text={text}
    7 │     ></div>
  
  i The set:text directive defines the element content here.
  
    4 │     <div
    5 │         set:html={html}
  > 6 │         set:text={text}
      │         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
    7 │     ></div>
    8 │ )}</div>
  
  i The set:html and set:text directives replace child content, so conflicting content sources may be ignored.
  
  i Choose only one content source for this element.
  
  i This rule belongs to the nursery group, which means it is not yet stable and may change in the future. Visit https://biomejs.dev/linter/#nursery for more information.
  

```

